   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "CHUNKED V2V SWAP \u2014 needs no ComfyUI patch\n\nH3 Chunk Plan works out WHERE to cut. Read its info before running:\nit lists every chunk, which are off the audio grid, and where it found\nscene cuts. Nothing loads, so it costs nothing to check.\n\nOpen hands out ONE chunk. Close captures the chain between them and\nrepeats it for every chunk, then joins the results.\n\n  Open ALONE emits chunk 0 \u2014 so bypass Close while you build and debug,\n  and the graph behaves as an ordinary single-chunk swap.\n\nREAD CLOSE'S INFO BEFORE A LONG RUN. It lists what it will clone. The\nVAE and the SAM checkpoint must appear under 'shared, NOT cloned'. If a\nloader is in the body list, stop \u2014 it would load once per chunk.\n\nchunk_frames is also the IDENTITY lever: a reference is a fixed token\ncount while the target grows, so 3 refs hold 19.4% of the picture tokens\nat 39 frames and 3.2% at 294. Shorter chunks hold the character better."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
